The supplied Compose deployment references the separate official Alpine-based
ClamAV 1.5.3 container (GPL-2.0) for malware scanning and pins its OCI digest.
The currently approved upstream image is published for linux/amd64. ClamAV
source and notices are available from https://github.com/Cisco-Talos/clamav
and its image documentation. The file-type MIME detector is MIT-licensed and
available from https://github.com/sindresorhus/file-type. The Lexical editor
modules are MIT-licensed and available from
https://github.com/facebook/lexical.

